\tag{fdip}
\title{The internal module and its actual columns}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The [internal right algebra](fdip-00VK) acts on one
Hurwitz coefficient in every based cell. Its module rank
counts those coefficients. A decomposition into simple
representations needs an additional calculation over the
chosen field.}

